{"4592080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Schoolgirl vs Fishman", "steam_appid": 4592080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High School Girls × Fish Creatures × Sewers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soaked, no-escape horror adventure.<br>A girl wakes up in an unfamiliar underground sewer—<br>with no belongings and no memory of how she got there.<br>As she searches for a way out, something lurks behind her…<br>Grotesque “fish creatures” begin to close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/00f66eacc970d900f870ddd6436e2873.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Mysterious Underground Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a sewer.<br>Twisted ruins and unknown structures intertwine beneath the surface.<br>Who built this place—and why?<br>Operate switches and levers, uncover hidden keys,<br>and search for a path back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/536ecc23a594b8aebe858acf1401aba1.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/9a4a3886756ce6da2c5a23f2ba034027.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run… or Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These girls can’t stand against the creatures barehanded.<br>Your only option is to run.<br>But if you find weapons like bats or pipes,<br>you might stand a chance.<br><br>Be careful—every weapon can break.<br>One mistake could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/6849c9aaa0ac88dc9a975eb27d8334f7.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Shape Their Fate</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine the girls’ fate.<br>Will everyone make it out alive—<br>…or will no one survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/952be8148b712ecf5552c69c24f394f2.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High School Girls × Fish Creatures × Sewers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soaked, no-escape horror adventure.<br>A girl wakes up in an unfamiliar underground sewer—<br>with no belongings and no memory of how she got there.<br>As she searches for a way out, something lurks behind her…<br>Grotesque “fish creatures” begin to close in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/00f66eacc970d900f870ddd6436e2873.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Mysterious Underground Facility</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just a sewer.<br>Twisted ruins and unknown structures intertwine beneath the surface.<br>Who built this place—and why?<br>Operate switches and levers, uncover hidden keys,<br>and search for a path back to the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/536ecc23a594b8aebe858acf1401aba1.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 height=540 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592080/extras/9a4a3886756ce6da2c5a23f2ba034027.avif?t=1779084876\" width=960 heigh